      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Followup: OBS Game Capture can be told to pick up on transparency, and VRChat window supports this, according to Tupper in this weeks (Feb 10th 2023) Developer update it's been possible to capture transparency for 3 years. \n\nI think NDI would be fine for a PC, but the lack of compression seems like it'd require too much bandwidth on Quest.",
