  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Would be awesome to have to have the stream camera output video and audio over NDI.  Would be a more efficient way to output to an external PC than having to use OBS.\n\nNDI supports alpha channel as well and could allow for output in \"cutout\" mode without having to rely on a chroma key\n\nTheoretically this could allow a quest user to stream to an external OBS as well.",
